    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><dateline><rs ref="#tillich_place_id__779" type="place">Brooklyn</rs>, <date
                            when="1945-12-11">Dec 11th 45</date>
                        <lb/>62 Willow Str. <lb/>Main 4 3481</dateline><salute>Dear <rs
                            ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Prof.
                        Tillich</rs>:</salute>
                </opener>
                <p>Some time ago I got through our mutual friend <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3355"
                        type="person">Annie Schindler</rs>, who is still in <rs
                        ref="#tillich_place_id__271" type="place">London</rs>, a copy of a letter of
                        <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3356" type="person">her brother</rs> in <rs
                        ref="#tillich_place_id__37" type="place">Berlin</rs>, who gives a very vivid
                    and moving report about the last 4 years and what they have gone through, And
                    there is hardly any experience they have <hi rend="u">not</hi> gone through! I
                    would like to send you this letter,<note type="ea">Liegt nicht vor.</note> not
                    only because I think you might be personally interested, but because I know that
                    you are the person, who could take an active interest and could do or suggest
                    something to help those poor starving people.</p>
                <p>I could not find your address in the telephone Directory, therefore I try to get
                    in touch with you in this way and would be abliged if you would send me your
                    address to which I will then forward the letter.</p>
                <closer><salute>Sincerely yours,</salute><signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3354"
                            type="person">Gertrud Müller-Munk</rs></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
